@host = http://localhost:5080

### Create a short URL
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/some/really/long/path?with=query&params=true"
}

### Create another short URL (used for the requests below)
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/core/fundamentals/minimal-apis"
}

### Look up a short URL's details by its code (replace with a code from a response above)
GET {{host}}/api/urls/ODcCk

### Follow the short URL - redirects to the original URL and records a click
GET {{host}}/ODcCk

### Get click analytics for a short code (total clicks + recent click history)
GET {{host}}/api/urls/ODcCk/analytics

### Invalid URL - expect 400 with a validation problem response
POST {{host}}/api/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "not-a-valid-url"
}

### Unknown short code - expect 404
GET {{host}}/api/urls/doesnotexist/analytics
